This package calls the operating system PC/SC implementation through node-ctypes.
It does not distribute winscard.dll, PCSC.framework, pcsc-lite or card drivers.

Native API/ABI references:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/winscard/
https://pcsclite.apdu.fr/api/
https://github.com/LudovicRousseau/PCSC/tree/master/src/PCSC
https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/SmartCardServices/tree/main/src/PCSC

Platform PC/SC libraries and drivers remain subject to their own licenses.
